      "title": "Qwen3.8 VL · Model setup",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen3.8 VL model\n\n### Model structure\n- Qwen3.8-27B dense multimodal language model\n- GGUF main weights + matching `mmproj` vision projector\n- Local inference through CUDA `llama.cpp`\n\n### Model directory\nPlace both files in:\n\n`ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8/`\n\n### Recommended starting point\nUse Unsloth UD-Q4_K_M with its matching `mmproj-BF16.gguf` on a 32 GB card. Keep the main model and projector from the same source.\n\n### Downloads\n- Unsloth: https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF\n- Huihui Abliterated: https://huggingface.co/huihui-ai/Huihui-Qwen3.8-27B-abliterated-GGUF\n- Orcarouter Uncensored: https://huggingface.co/orcarouter/Qwen3.8-27B-Uncensored-GGUF\n\n### Basic connection\n`Qwen3.8 VL Local Loader` → `Vision LLM Chat` → `Preview as Text`\n"
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#31465c"
    },
